hings that matter."/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/node_modules_next_dist_build_polyfills_polyfill-nomodule.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a><header class="border-b border-stone-200"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-6"><a href="#main" class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Stark Studio<span class="text-orange-700">.</span></a><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primary-navigation" class="rounded-full border border-stone-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold md:hidden">Open menu</button><nav id="primary-navigation" aria-label="Primary" class="hidden w-full flex-col gap-5 border-t border-stone-200 pt-5 md:flex md:w-auto md:flex-row md:border-0 md:pt-0"><a href="#approach" class="py-1 text-sm font-semibold underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Approach</a><a href="#about" class="py-1 text-sm font-semibold underline-offset-4 hover:underline">About</a></nav></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6"><section aria-labelledby="hero-heading" class="grid items-center gap-12 py-16 md:grid-cols-2 md:py-24"><div><p class="mb-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange-800">A small studio. A fresh perspective.</p><h1 id="hero-heading" class="max-w-xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-6xl">Make room for your next idea.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600">A thoughtful starting point for what comes next. Clear words, useful details, and a little space to explore.</p><a href="#approach" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-full bg-stone-900 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-stone-700">Explore our approach<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><img alt="An orange sun above sculptural arches and a green hillside" width="600" height="640" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full rounded-3xl" style="color:transparent" src="/images/starter.svg"/></section><section id="approach" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="approach-heading" class="border-t border-stone-200 py-16"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange-800">Our approach</p><h2 id="approach-heading" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Good things start with the essentials.</h2><div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><article><p class="text-sm text-orange-800">0<!-- -->1</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Start with purpose</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Give your idea a clear home. Keep the story focused on what matters to the people you want to reach.</p></article><article><p class="text-sm text-orange-800">0<!-- -->2</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Keep it simple</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Make every page easy to read, every detail useful, and every next step easy to find.</p></article><article><p class="text-sm text-orange-800">0<!-- -->3</p><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Make it yours</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-stone-600">Bring your own words and images. Build a place that feels like you, with room to grow over time.</p></article></div></section><section id="about" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="about-heading" class="mb-16 rounded-3xl bg-stone-200/60 p-8 md:p-12"><h2 id="about-heading" class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">A little space. A lot of possibility.</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-stone-600">We believe a good website begins with a clear idea and a human touch. This is a place for both. Take a look around, then make the next chapter your own.</p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class="border-t border-stone-200"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-8 text-sm text-stone-600"><p>Stark Studio<!-- --> · Made with intention.</p><a href="#main" class="underline underline-offset-4">Back to